63	 * - Audio is assigned to an audio device based on its AudioAttributes usage
64	 *
65	 * When audio dynamic routing is disabled:
66	 * - There is exactly one audio zone, which is the primary zone
67	 * - Each volume group represents a controllable STREAM_TYPE, same as AudioManager
